Error [E0104]: `task` needs a zero-parameter body, got 1 parameter
  --> tests/ui/task_spawn_parameters.jet:2:14
    |
  2 |     t :: task (x: Int) => x
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a task body captures values from the enclosing scope — it takes no parameters
 Fix: move data in via capture instead of lambda parameters
